<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<subsection xml:id="instructional_methods" label="instructional_methods" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Instructional Methods</title>

  <p>
    This course is offered as a face-to-face course.
    Class meetings combine student presentations of proofs, discussion of those presentations, and interactive lecture on the longer proofs, in an approach known as inquiry-based learning.
    Learning will also be facilitated through homework, a proof portfolio, and in-class exams.
  </p>
</subsection>
